    "title": "The CEO of the most powerful AI company said his own problem is forgetting",
    "description": "The headline from Sam Altman on Relentless was the singularity. The more useful line was the one where he compared himself to a not-very-smart AI model that holds a lot of context and then loses it.",
    "date": "2026-08-19",
